        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 48 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 48 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back to back mounting. It is easy to install and will look great with proper care for years to come. The Oil Rubbed Bronze 48 Inch Rectangular Pull is made from durable stainless steel, making it ideal for high-traffic areas. The oil rubbed bronze finish is a deep, chocolatey color with no highlights. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>24 Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>36\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/60-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>60\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/72-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>72\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL48-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 48-3/4\" (1240mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 48\" (1220mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL48-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL48 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "48 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull",
                "description": "The 48 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back to back mounting. It is easy to install and will look great with proper care for years to come. The Oil Rubbed Bronze 48 Inch Rectangular Pull is made from durable stainless steel, making it ideal for high-traffic areas. The oil rubbed bronze finish is a deep, chocolatey color with no highlights.",
